    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a shaman, you gain the following class features.</p><h2>Hit Points</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8 per shaman level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 8 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d8 (or 5) + your Constitution modifier per shaman level after 1st</p><h2>Proficiencies</h2><p><strong>Armor:</strong> Light armor, medium armor, shields</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple weapons</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong> Herbalism kit</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Strength, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Choose two from Animal handling, Arcana, History, Insight, Medicine, Nature, Perception, and Survival</p><h2>Equipment</h2><p>You start with the following equipment, in addition to the equipment granted by your background:</p><ul><li><p>(a) hide armor or (b) leather armor</p></li><li><p>(a) a mace and shield or (b) two simple weapons</p></li><li><p>(a) a dungeoneer's pack or (b) an explorer's pack</p></li><li><p>a druidic focus</p></li></ul><h2>Class Table</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1st</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>2</strong></p></td><td><p>Kalimag, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.aVi5pp9WHzFvCfv3]{Spellcasting}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>2nd</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>2</strong></p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.TMwoqa3wiGFCrA1i]{Totemist (2/rest)}, Elemental Attunement</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3rd</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>2</strong></p></td><td><p>Shamanic Binding</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>4th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>2</strong></p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>5th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3</strong></p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.DqXV6iUM30BSNPLs]{Spirit Beast}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>6th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3</strong></p></td><td><p>Shamanic Binding feature</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>7th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>8th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3</strong></p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>9th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>4</strong></p></td><td><p>Elemental Attunement improvements</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>10th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>4</strong></p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.TMwoqa3wiGFCrA1i]{Totemist (3/rest)}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.cqcYt6dHxV3iklG4]{Totemic Projection}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"46\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>11th</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"72\"><p style=\"text-align:center